pan class=3D"max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Subnet=
 Alpha</span><span class=3D"-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-=
1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
<p data-start=3D"4669" data-end=3D"4689">If your miner often:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4691" data-end=3D"4747">
<li data-start=3D"4691" data-end=3D"4703">
<p data-start=3D"4693" data-end=3D"4703">Times out,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4704" data-end=3D"4717">
<p data-start=3D"4706" data-end=3D"4717">Crashes, or</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4718" data-end=3D"4747">
<p data-start=3D"4720" data-end=3D"4747">Returns invalid JSON/shape,</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"4749" data-end=3D"4874">you=E2=80=99ll get a bunch of <str=
ong data-start=3D"4771" data-end=3D"4795">-1.0 penalty entries</strong>, wh=
ich after normalization make you look extremely bad (negative performance).=
</p>
<p data-start=3D"4876" data-end=3D"4882">Check:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4884" data-end=3D"5089">
<li data-start=3D"4884" data-end=3D"4927">
<p data-start=3D"4886" data-end=3D"4927">Your <strong data-start=3D"4891" d=
ata-end=3D"4912">inference latency</strong> (per request).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4928" data-end=3D"4997">
<p data-start=3D"4930" data-end=3D"4997">Whether your process is ever <stro=
ng data-start=3D"4959" data-end=3D"4973">OOM-killed</strong> or restarted m=
id-query.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4998" data-end=3D"5089">
<p data-start=3D"5000" data-end=3D"5089">If you=E2=80=99re doing heavy stuf=
f (like big transformer models) synchronously without batching.</p>
</li>
</ul>
