<p data-start=3D"1814" data-end=3D"1848">No ML (just external forecast API)=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1849" data-end=3D"1860">
<p data-start=3D"1851" data-end=3D"1860">Any model</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"1862" data-end=3D"1934"><strong data-start=3D"1866" data-=
end=3D"1932">(B) Researchers training better models =E2=86=92 improving sub=
net SOTA</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1935" data-end=3D"1953">These researchers:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1955" data-end=3D"2082">
