</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2084" data-end=3D"2151">Zeus explicitly wants <strong data=
-start=3D"2106" data-end=3D"2120">innovation</strong> + <strong data-start=
=3D"2123" data-end=3D"2150">performance competition</strong>.</p>
