<p data-start=3D"4485" data-end=3D"4532">So the <strong data-start=3D"4492"=
 data-end=3D"4508">target shape</strong> for the model is clear:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4534" data-end=3D"4641">
<li data-start=3D"4534" data-end=3D"4605">
<p data-start=3D"4536" data-end=3D"4605">Input: something like <code data-s=
