<p data-start=3D"6502" data-end=3D"6539">Creates <code data-start=3D"6510" =
data-end=3D"6518">(X, y)</code> pairs: past =E2=86=92 future</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6542" data-end=3D"6603">
<p data-start=3D"6544" data-end=3D"6603">Trains a simple <strong data-start=
=3D"6560" data-end=3D"6571">ConvNet</strong> or small <strong data-start=3D=
"6581" data-end=3D"6590">U-Net</strong> per variable</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6606" data-end=3D"6667">
<p data-start=3D"6608" data-end=3D"6667">Saves weights as <code data-start=
=3D"6625" data-end=3D"6644">model_dewpoint.pt</code>, <code data-start=3D"6=
646" data-end=3D"6661">model_u100.pt</code>, etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6669" data-end=3D"6835">
<p data-start=3D"6671" data-end=3D"6683">Show how to:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6686" data-end=3D"6835">
<li data-start=3D"6686" data-end=3D"6725">
<p data-start=3D"6688" data-end=3D"6725">Load this model in <code data-star=
t=3D"6707" data-end=3D"6725">neurons/miner.py</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6728" data-end=3D"6783">
<p data-start=3D"6730" data-end=3D"6783">Replace the Open-Meteo API block w=
ith model inference</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6786" data-end=3D"6835">
<p data-start=3D"6788" data-end=3D"6835">Keep the exact shape <code data-st=
art=3D"6809" data-end=3D"6820">(T, H, W)</code> and ERA5 units</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6837" data-end=3D"6900">You don=E2=80=99t need the <code d=
ata-start=3D"6856" data-end=3D"6862">.npy</code> files for that first worki=
ng version.</p>
