<hr data-start=3D"776" data-end=3D"779">
<h2 data-start=3D"781" data-end=3D"798">=F0=9F=A7=A0 Assumptions</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"800" data-end=3D"1153">
<li data-start=3D"800" data-end=3D"857">
<p data-start=3D"802" data-end=3D"857">ERA5 files are <strong data-start=3D=
"817" data-end=3D"850">reanalysis-era5-single-levels</strong> NetCDF</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"858" data-end=3D"970">
<p data-start=3D"860" data-end=3D"970">Variable name matches ERA5 (e.g. <co=
de data-start=3D"893" data-end=3D"918">2m_dewpoint_temperature</code>, <cod=
e data-start=3D"920" data-end=3D"936">2m_temperature</code>, <code data-sta=
rt=3D"938" data-end=3D"963">10m_u_component_of_wind</code>, etc.)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"971" data-end=3D"1153">
<p data-start=3D"973" data-end=3D"976">We:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"980" data-end=3D"1153">
<li data-start=3D"980" data-end=3D"1041">
<p data-start=3D"982" data-end=3D"1041">Train on <strong data-start=3D"991"=
 data-end=3D"1041">past <code data-start=3D"998" data-end=3D"1013">context_=
hours</code> =E2=86=92 future <code data-start=3D"1023" data-end=3D"1039">f=
orecast_hours</code></strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1044" data-end=3D"1093">
<p data-start=3D"1046" data-end=3D"1093">Use random 2D patches to keep memo=
ry reasonable</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1096" data-end=3D"1153">
<p data-start=3D"1098" data-end=3D"1153">Learn directly in <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"1116" data-end=3D"1130">ERA5 units</strong> (no weird conversions)</p=
>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
