<h1 data-start=3D"1707" data-end=3D"1757">=F0=9F=A7=A0 How often do <em dat=
a-start=3D"1725" data-end=3D"1742">top Zeus miners</em> download ERA5?</h1>
<ul data-start=3D"1759" data-end=3D"1869">
<li data-start=3D"1759" data-end=3D"1786">
<p data-start=3D"1761" data-end=3D"1786"><strong data-start=3D"1761" data-e=
nd=3D"1779">Normal miners:</strong> once</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1787" data-end=3D"1826">
<p data-start=3D"1789" data-end=3D"1826"><strong data-start=3D"1789" data-e=
nd=3D"1817">High-performance miners:</strong> yearly</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1827" data-end=3D"1869">
<p data-start=3D"1829" data-end=3D"1869"><strong data-start=3D"1829" data-e=
nd=3D"1857">Leaderboard competitors:</strong> quarterly</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1871" data-end=3D"1923">But you can train with just <stron=
g data-start=3D"1899" data-end=3D"1913">1=E2=80=933 months</strong> at firs=
t.</p>
