-end=3D"445">broken partial file</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"446" data-end=3D"475">
<p data-start=3D"448" data-end=3D"475">Or a <strong data-start=3D"453" data=
-end=3D"475">JSON error message</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"476" data-end=3D"509">
<p data-start=3D"478" data-end=3D"509">But <strong data-start=3D"482" data-=
end=3D"489">NOT</strong> a valid NetCDF file</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"511" data-end=3D"557">This is exactly what Copernicus CDS =
does when:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"559" data-end=3D"773">
<li data-start=3D"559" data-end=3D"587">
<p data-start=3D"561" data-end=3D"587">your request was invalid</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"588" data-end=3D"620">
<p data-start=3D"590" data-end=3D"620">or the API key was incorrect</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"621" data-end=3D"654">
<p data-start=3D"623" data-end=3D"654">or the dataset name was wrong</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"655" data-end=3D"680">
<p data-start=3D"657" data-end=3D"680">or CDS was overloaded</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"681" data-end=3D"715">
<p data-start=3D"683" data-end=3D"715">or your download was cut short</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"716" data-end=3D"746">
<p data-start=3D"718" data-end=3D"746">or network issues occurred</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"747" data-end=3D"773">
<p data-start=3D"749" data-end=3D"773">or file failed halfway</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"775" data-end=3D"854">CDS returns an <strong data-start=3D=
"790" data-end=3D"817">error page INSIDE a ZIP</strong>, even though the ex=
tension is <code data-start=3D"848" data-end=3D"853">.nc</code>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"856" data-end=3D"896">This is why the file is ZIP, not Net=
CDF.</p>
