<h2 data-start=3D"3259" data-end=3D"3332"><strong data-start=3D"3262" data-=
end=3D"3332">Do you want to train on full global grid (721=C3=971440) or do=
wnsample?</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3334" data-end=3D"3359">=E2=9D=8C GLOBAL GRID ISSUES:</h3=
>
<ul data-start=3D"3360" data-end=3D"3479">
<li data-start=3D"3360" data-end=3D"3390">
<p data-start=3D"3362" data-end=3D"3390">3GB per variable per month</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3391" data-end=3D"3419">
<p data-start=3D"3393" data-end=3D"3419">Memory is extremely high</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3420" data-end=3D"3467">
<p data-start=3D"3422" data-end=3D"3467">Full training on CPU or small GPU =
may crash</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3468" data-end=3D"3479">
<p data-start=3D"3470" data-end=3D"3479">Very slow</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3481" data-end=3D"3508">=E2=9C=94 Recommended approach:</=
h3>
<p data-start=3D"3509" data-end=3D"3523">Downsample to:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3525" data-end=3D"3656">
<li data-start=3D"3525" data-end=3D"3558">
<p data-start=3D"3527" data-end=3D"3558">1=C2=B0 grid =E2=86=92 181=C3=9736=
0 (20=C3=97 smaller)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3559" data-end=3D"3591">
<p data-start=3D"3561" data-end=3D"3591">2=C2=B0 grid =E2=86=92 91=C3=97180=
 (80=C3=97 smaller)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3592" data-end=3D"3656">
<p data-start=3D"3594" data-end=3D"3656">Or crop only region around client =
lat/lon (Zeus variable grid)</p>
</li>
</ul>
