=3D"2920" data-end=3D"2934">models_root/</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2935" data-end=3D"2978">
<p data-start=3D"2937" data-end=3D"2978">Finds all folders containing <code=
 data-start=3D"2966" data-end=3D"2978">model_*.pt</code></p>
</li>
