</li>
<li data-start=3D"3012" data-end=3D"3050">
<p data-start=3D"3014" data-end=3D"3050">Handles missing variables graceful=
ly</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3051" data-end=3D"3094">
<p data-start=3D"3053" data-end=3D"3094">Supports 1=E2=80=938 variables (no=
t all required)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3095" data-end=3D"3153">
<p data-start=3D"3097" data-end=3D"3153">Supports future re-trained models =
without modifying code</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3154" data-end=3D"3263">
<p data-start=3D"3156" data-end=3D"3171">Miner warns if:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3174" data-end=3D"3263">
