<p data-start=3D"3807" data-end=3D"3837"><strong data-start=3D"3807" data-e=
nd=3D"3837">No long 120-second lockups</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3838" data-end=3D"3857">
<p data-start=3D"3840" data-end=3D"3857"><strong data-start=3D"3840" data-e=
nd=3D"3857">Fewer retries</strong></p>
