<h2 data-start=3D"821" data-end=3D"866">2=EF=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 Does 1=C2=B0 re=
solution hurt model quality?</h2>
<p data-start=3D"868" data-end=3D"902">For Zeus subnet 18, the validator:</=
p>
<ul data-start=3D"904" data-end=3D"1125">
<li data-start=3D"904" data-end=3D"958">
<p data-start=3D"906" data-end=3D"958">Sends you <strong data-start=3D"916"=
