p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"959" data-end=3D"1027">
<p data-start=3D"961" data-end=3D"1027">Evaluates on relatively coarse patt=
erns (not micro-scale storms)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1028" data-end=3D"1125">
<p data-start=3D"1030" data-end=3D"1125">Cares about getting =E2=80=9Clarge=
-scale weather=E2=80=9D right: fronts, temperature fields, pressure gradien=
ts</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1127" data-end=3D"1148">1=C2=B0 grid is enough to:</p>
