<p data-start=3D"1115" data-end=3D"1202"><code data-start=3D"1115" data-end=
=3D"1127">pool.map()</code> mistakenly spawns new workers if the task adapt=
er sees timeout or failure.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1204" data-end=3D"1237">This is <strong data-start=3D"1212=
" data-end=3D"1231">normal behavior</strong> when:</p>
