4 processes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7046" data-end=3D"7106">
<p data-start=3D"7048" data-end=3D"7106">Each process <strong data-start=3D=
"7061" data-end=3D"7075">never dies</strong>, so pool never respawns more</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7107" data-end=3D"7161">
