</li>
<li data-start=3D"7208" data-end=3D"7243">
<p data-start=3D"7210" data-end=3D"7243">Safe logging, no infinite retries<=
/p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"7245" data-end=3D"7263">If you later want:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"7265" data-end=3D"7380">
