<p data-start=3D"4295" data-end=3D"4386">At 25=E2=80=9330 MB per month, tot=
al time is ~15=E2=80=9320 seconds per file =E2=86=92 no need for paralleliz=
ation.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4388" data-end=3D"4435">2. <strong data-start=3D"4395" da=
ta-end=3D"4433">CDS API hates multiple connections</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4436" data-end=3D"4485">Single-thread mode never triggers =
rate limit 429.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4487" data-end=3D"4524">3. <strong data-start=3D"4494" da=
