<h3 data-start=3D"4601" data-end=3D"4647">4. <strong data-start=3D"4608" da=
ta-end=3D"4645">Less complexity, more reliability</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4648" data-end=3D"4739">No multiprocessing<br data-start=
=3D"4666" data-end=3D"4669">
