data-end=3D"1266">old workers are zombies</strong> =E2=80=94 stuck on block=
ing I/O.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1293" data-end=3D"1296">
<h1 data-start=3D"1298" data-end=3D"1329">=F0=9F=9F=A9 So what should you d=
o now?</h1>
<h2 data-start=3D"1331" data-end=3D"1352">=E2=9C=85 Best solution:</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"1353" data-end=3D"1413">=E2=AD=90 <strong data-start=3D"1=
359" data-end=3D"1411">Switch to single-thread downloader (no parallel)</st=
rong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1414" data-end=3D"1467">You already asked for it, and I de=
livered the script.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1469" data-end=3D"1498">Why this is best <em data-start=3D=
"1486" data-end=3D"1497">right now</em>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1500" data-end=3D"1774">
<li data-start=3D"1500" data-end=3D"1537">
<p data-start=3D"1502" data-end=3D"1537">It <strong data-start=3D"1505" dat=
a-end=3D"1514">never</strong> spawns extra workers</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1538" data-end=3D"1562">
<p data-start=3D"1540" data-end=3D"1562">It <strong data-start=3D"1543" dat=
a-end=3D"1552">never</strong> crashes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1563" data-end=3D"1607">
<p data-start=3D"1565" data-end=3D"1607">It <strong data-start=3D"1568" dat=
a-end=3D"1577">never</strong> causes rate-limit explosion</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1608" data-end=3D"1643">
<p data-start=3D"1610" data-end=3D"1643">It <strong data-start=3D"1613" dat=
a-end=3D"1622">never</strong> creates duplicates</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1644" data-end=3D"1664">
<p data-start=3D"1646" data-end=3D"1664">It is <strong data-start=3D"1652" =
data-end=3D"1662">stable</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1665" data-end=3D"1704">
<p data-start=3D"1667" data-end=3D"1704">It <strong data-start=3D"1670" dat=
a-end=3D"1702">automatically retries safely</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1705" data-end=3D"1774">
<p data-start=3D"1707" data-end=3D"1774">It gives consistent results while =
you=E2=80=99re downloading large datasets</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1776" data-end=3D"1842">For 0.5=C2=B0 + 1h files (100=E2=
=80=93180 MB/month), parallel is not necessary.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1844" data-end=3D"1847">
<h1 data-start=3D"1849" data-end=3D"1901">=F0=9F=9F=A5 DO NOT reuse the old=
 <code data-start=3D"1875" data-end=3D"1894">Pool(processes=3D8)</code> scr=
ipt</h1>
<p data-start=3D"1902" data-end=3D"1913">Here=E2=80=99s why:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1915" data-end=3D"2286">
<li data-start=3D"1915" data-end=3D"1977">
<p data-start=3D"1917" data-end=3D"1977">Your current terminal session stil=
l has old zombie workers</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1978" data-end=3D"2040">
<p data-start=3D"1980" data-end=3D"2040">Even if you stop the script, the p=
rocesses may still exist</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2041" data-end=3D"2083">
<p data-start=3D"2043" data-end=3D"2083">Starting again will attach new wor=
kers</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2084" data-end=3D"2111">
<p data-start=3D"2086" data-end=3D"2111">Downloads will conflict</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2112" data-end=3D"2164">
<p data-start=3D"2114" data-end=3D"2164">Many parallel requests =E2=86=92 m=
assive 429 rate limits</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2165" data-end=3D"2197">
<p data-start=3D"2167" data-end=3D"2197">Some files will be corrupted</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2198" data-end=3D"2232">
<p data-start=3D"2200" data-end=3D"2232">Some months will fail silently</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2233" data-end=3D"2286">
<p data-start=3D"2235" data-end=3D"2286">You will need to manually delete b=
roken <code data-start=3D"2275" data-end=3D"2280">.nc</code> files</p>
</li>
</ul>
