<hr data-start=3D"2798" data-end=3D"2801">
<h1 data-start=3D"2803" data-end=3D"2851">=F0=9F=9F=A3 If you INSIST on usi=
ng parallel downloading</h1>
<p data-start=3D"2852" data-end=3D"2901">I can give you a <strong data-star=
t=3D"2869" data-end=3D"2900">limited concurrency version</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2903" data-end=3D"3098">
<li data-start=3D"2903" data-end=3D"2921">
