<p data-start=3D"236" data-end=3D"383">=E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F <strong data-star=
t=3D"239" data-end=3D"306">You cannot train a single model with mixed spati=
al resolutions.</strong><br data-start=3D"306" data-end=3D"309">
The UNet always expects the <strong data-start=3D"337" data-end=3D"356">sam=
e grid shape</strong> for every training sample.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"385" data-end=3D"429">If even ONE file has a different gr=
id:</h3>
<p data-start=3D"430" data-end=3D"544">=E2=86=92 Training will crash<br dat=
