<h1 data-start=3D"551" data-end=3D"611">=F0=9F=9B=91 You MUST train each va=
riable with consistent resolution</h1>
<p data-start=3D"613" data-end=3D"621">Meaning:</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"623" data-end=3D"666">=E2=9D=97 ALL files for 2m_temperat=
ure must be:</h3>
