<p data-start=3D"402" data-end=3D"443">All Zeus miners struggle with it bec=
ause:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"445" data-end=3D"671">
<li data-start=3D"445" data-end=3D"483">
<p data-start=3D"447" data-end=3D"483">Values are <strong data-start=3D"458=
" data-end=3D"468">sparse</strong> (often zero)</p>
