</strong>, but <strong data-start=3D"700" data-end=3D"728">with padding dif=
ferences</strong>, it sometimes overshoots to 361 or 362 or =C3=972.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"776" data-end=3D"779">
<h1 data-start=3D"781" data-end=3D"823">=E2=9C=85 Fix: Make decoder match e=
ncoder shapes</h1>
<p data-start=3D"824" data-end=3D"895">Your model upsampling expects <stron=
g data-start=3D"854" data-end=3D"883">perfect divisibility by 2</strong> ma=
ny times.</p>
<p data-start=3D"897" data-end=3D"949">But 360 / 2 / 2 =3D 90 (good)<br>
720 / 2 / 2 =3D 180 (good)</p>
