<hr data-start=3D"2399" data-end=3D"2402">
<h1 data-start=3D"2404" data-end=3D"2423">=F0=9F=8E=AF Why this works</h1>
<p data-start=3D"2425" data-end=3D"2465">No matter what ConvTranspose2d pro=
duces:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2467" data-end=3D"2526">
<li data-start=3D"2467" data-end=3D"2481">
<p data-start=3D"2469" data-end=3D"2481">360 vs 361</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2482" data-end=3D"2496">
<p data-start=3D"2484" data-end=3D"2496">720 vs 722</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2497" data-end=3D"2526">
<p data-start=3D"2499" data-end=3D"2526">720 vs 360 (full =C3=972 glitch)</=
p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2528" data-end=3D"2603">We always <strong data-start=3D"25=
38" data-end=3D"2571">crop them to the smaller size</strong>, so concatenat=
ion always works.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2605" data-end=3D"2679">This does not reduce accuracy =E2=
=80=94 it is common in UNet for mismatched grids.</p>
