<p data-start=3D"724" data-end=3D"739">You should see:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"741" data-end=3D"821">
<li data-start=3D"741" data-end=3D"770">
<p data-start=3D"743" data-end=3D"770"><strong data-start=3D"743" data-end=
=3D"770">80=E2=80=93100% GPU utilization</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"771" data-end=3D"795">
<p data-start=3D"773" data-end=3D"795"><strong data-start=3D"773" data-end=
=3D"795">8=E2=80=9314 GB VRAM usage</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"796" data-end=3D"821">
<p data-start=3D"798" data-end=3D"821"><code data-start=3D"798" data-end=3D=
"806">python</code> process at top</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"823" data-end=3D"922">If you see 0%, something is wrong =
=E2=80=94 but based on log speed (10 it/s), GPU <strong data-start=3D"897" =
data-end=3D"921">is definitely active</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"924" data-end=3D"927">
<h1 data-start=3D"929" data-end=3D"995">=E2=AD=90 This is exactly the expec=
ted speed for the precipitation model</h1>
<p data-start=3D"997" data-end=3D"1028">Precip is the hardest variable:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1030" data-end=3D"1112">
<li data-start=3D"1030" data-end=3D"1044">
<p data-start=3D"1032" data-end=3D"1044">Very noisy</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1045" data-end=3D"1060">
<p data-start=3D"1047" data-end=3D"1060">Very sparse</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1061" data-end=3D"1079">
<p data-start=3D"1063" data-end=3D"1079">Requires log1p</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1080" data-end=3D"1112">
<p data-start=3D"1082" data-end=3D"1112">Needs 40=E2=80=9360 epochs to conv=
erge</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1114" data-end=3D"1139">So you're right on track.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1141" data-end=3D"1144">
<h1 data-start=3D"1146" data-end=3D"1212">=E2=9C=94 Want me to add ETA prin=
ting &amp; checkpoint saving every N steps?</h1>
<p data-start=3D"1214" data-end=3D"1246">I can update the script to show:</=
p>
<ul data-start=3D"1248" data-end=3D"1407">
<li data-start=3D"1248" data-end=3D"1276">
<p data-start=3D"1250" data-end=3D"1276">remaining time per epoch</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1277" data-end=3D"1310">
<p data-start=3D"1279" data-end=3D"1310">estimated final training time</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1311" data-end=3D"1336">
<p data-start=3D"1313" data-end=3D"1336">GPU memory monitoring</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1337" data-end=3D"1355">
<p data-start=3D"1339" data-end=3D"1355">loss smoothing</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1356" data-end=3D"1407">
<p data-start=3D"1358" data-end=3D"1407">progress checkpoints (e.g., save e=
very 10k steps)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1409" data-end=3D"1418">Just say:</p>
<p data-start=3D"1420" data-end=3D"1459">=F0=9F=91=89 <strong data-start=3D=
"1423" data-end=3D"1459">"Yes, add ETA + smarter logging"</strong></p>
