<h3 data-start=3D"154" data-end=3D"199">=E2=9C=94 <strong data-start=3D"160=
" data-end=3D"199">Why was the default value set to 5?</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"201" data-end=3D"287">Because <strong data-start=3D"209" d=
ata-end=3D"263">the default was originally meant for QUICK TESTING</strong>=
, not for real training.</p>
<p data-start=3D"289" data-end=3D"340">When building a training script for =
the first time:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"342" data-end=3D"539">
<li data-start=3D"342" data-end=3D"386">
<p data-start=3D"344" data-end=3D"386">You want to check that the dataset l=
oads</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"387" data-end=3D"426">
<p data-start=3D"389" data-end=3D"426">You want to check that shapes match<=
/p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"427" data-end=3D"460">
<p data-start=3D"429" data-end=3D"460">You want to confirm GPU works</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"461" data-end=3D"493">
<p data-start=3D"463" data-end=3D"493">You want to catch bugs early</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"494" data-end=3D"539">
<p data-start=3D"496" data-end=3D"539">You do NOT want to wait 2=E2=80=933 =
hours per run</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"541" data-end=3D"569">So developers typically set:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"571" data-end=3D"664">
<li data-start=3D"571" data-end=3D"602">
<p data-start=3D"573" data-end=3D"602">epochs =3D <strong data-start=3D"582=
" data-end=3D"589">3=E2=80=935</strong> by default</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"603" data-end=3D"664">
<p data-start=3D"605" data-end=3D"664">and then users manually set epochs h=
igher for real training</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"666" data-end=3D"714">=F0=9F=9A=AB It was never intended =
for real training</h3>
<p data-start=3D"715" data-end=3D"736">That default is ONLY:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"738" data-end=3D"837">
<li data-start=3D"738" data-end=3D"769">
<p data-start=3D"740" data-end=3D"769">to make the script run fast</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"770" data-end=3D"786">
<p data-start=3D"772" data-end=3D"786">to test code</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"787" data-end=3D"799">
<p data-start=3D"789" data-end=3D"799">to debug</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"800" data-end=3D"837">
<p data-start=3D"802" data-end=3D"837">to avoid waiting 1 hour per epoch</p=
>
</li>
</ul>
