<h1 data-start=3D"1768" data-end=3D"1821">=F0=9F=93=8C Why your GPU is usin=
g 21.7 GB VRAM with batch=3D2?</h1>
<p data-start=3D"1822" data-end=3D"1848">Because the model is huge:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1850" data-end=3D"2023">
<li data-start=3D"1850" data-end=3D"1861">
<p data-start=3D"1852" data-end=3D"1861">Base=3D64</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1862" data-end=3D"1878">
