<hr data-start=3D"1832" data-end=3D"1835">
<h2 data-start=3D"1837" data-end=3D"1886">4=EF=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 Watch the sub=
net dashboards (with a delay)</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1888" data-end=3D"1907">After registration:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1909" data-end=3D"2191">
<li data-start=3D"1909" data-end=3D"2076">
<p data-start=3D"1911" data-end=3D"1948">It usually takes <strong data-star=
t=3D"1928" data-end=3D"1943">some blocks</strong> for:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1951" data-end=3D"2076">
<li data-start=3D"1951" data-end=3D"2028">
<p data-start=3D"1953" data-end=3D"2028">your UID to show up on explorers (=
taomarketcap / tao.app / zeussubnet site)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2031" data-end=3D"2076">
<p data-start=3D"2033" data-end=3D"2076">weights / scores / emission to sta=
rt moving</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2077" data-end=3D"2191">
<p data-start=3D"2079" data-end=3D"2191">Early on, don=E2=80=99t panic abou=
t a negative % =E2=80=94 validators need some time to build history and com=
pare you vs others.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2193" data-end=3D"2215">What you <em data-start=3D"2202" d=
ata-end=3D"2207">can</em> do now:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2217" data-end=3D"2439">
<li data-start=3D"2217" data-end=3D"2321">
<p data-start=3D"2219" data-end=3D"2246">Check your miner hotkey on:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2249" data-end=3D"2321">
<li data-start=3D"2249" data-end=3D"2295">
<p data-start=3D"2251" data-end=3D"2295"><code data-start=3D"2251" data-end=
=3D"2295">https://taomarketcap.com/subnets/18/miners</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2298" data-end=3D"2321">
<p data-start=3D"2300" data-end=3D"2321">Zeus site miner table</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2322" data-end=3D"2439">
<p data-start=3D"2324" data-end=3D"2335">Check that:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2338" data-end=3D"2439">
<li data-start=3D"2338" data-end=3D"2365">
<p data-start=3D"2340" data-end=3D"2365">your <strong data-start=3D"2345" d=
ata-end=3D"2365">stake is visible</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2368" data-end=3D"2397">
<p data-start=3D"2370" data-end=3D"2397">UID is not <code data-start=3D"238=
1" data-end=3D"2397">404 / inactive</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2400" data-end=3D"2439">
<p data-start=3D"2402" data-end=3D"2439">you=E2=80=99re not =E2=80=9Cblackl=
isted=E2=80=9D or =E2=80=9Coffline=E2=80=9D</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2441" data-end=3D"2444">
<h2 data-start=3D"2446" data-end=3D"2475">5=EF=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 If something =
looks off</h2>
<p data-start=3D"2477" data-end=3D"2505">If after ~1=E2=80=932 hours you se=
e:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2507" data-end=3D"2582">
<li data-start=3D"2507" data-end=3D"2540">
<p data-start=3D"2509" data-end=3D"2540">No =E2=80=9CReceived request =E2=
=86=92 =E2=80=A6=E2=80=9D lines</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2541" data-end=3D"2582">
<p data-start=3D"2543" data-end=3D"2582">Or dashboards show <code data-star=
t=3D"2562" data-end=3D"2582">offline / 0 uptime</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2584" data-end=3D"2596">then likely:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2598" data-end=3D"2704">
<li data-start=3D"2598" data-end=3D"2626">
<p data-start=3D"2600" data-end=3D"2626">miner not actually running</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2627" data-end=3D"2704">
<p data-start=3D"2629" data-end=3D"2704">or crashed due to some runtime err=
or (Open-Meteo 429, shape mismatch, etc.)</p>
</li>
</ul>
