<p data-start=3D"7885" data-end=3D"7906">Key things this does:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"7908" data-end=3D"8363">
<li data-start=3D"7908" data-end=3D"8129">
<p data-start=3D"7911" data-end=3D"7945"><strong data-start=3D"7911" data-e=
nd=3D"7926">Small grids</strong> (like <code data-start=3D"7933" data-end=
