<ul data-start=3D"7949" data-end=3D"8129">
<li data-start=3D"7949" data-end=3D"7989">
<p data-start=3D"7951" data-end=3D"7989"><code data-start=3D"7951" data-end=
=3D"7965">min(H,W) &lt; 8</code> =E2=86=92 skip UNet completely.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7993" data-end=3D"8053">
<p data-start=3D"7995" data-end=3D"8053">Use <code data-start=3D"7999" data=
-end=3D"8024">_persistence_fallback()</code> =E2=86=92 repeat last context =
frame.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8057" data-end=3D"8129">
<p data-start=3D"8059" data-end=3D"8129">No more =E2=80=9Csize of tensor a =
