<hr data-start=3D"161" data-end=3D"164">
<h3 data-start=3D"166" data-end=3D"189">1. What=E2=80=99s the same?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"191" data-end=3D"230">Both <strong data-start=3D"196" data=
-end=3D"208">ZeusUNet</strong> and <strong data-start=3D"213" data-end=3D"2=
25">WindUNet</strong> are:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"232" data-end=3D"500">
<li data-start=3D"232" data-end=3D"267">
<p data-start=3D"234" data-end=3D"267">UNet-style encoder=E2=80=93decoder C=
NNs</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"268" data-end=3D"312">
<p data-start=3D"270" data-end=3D"312">Take input: <code data-start=3D"282"=
 data-end=3D"312">[batch, context_hours, H, W]</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"313" data-end=3D"354">
<p data-start=3D"315" data-end=3D"354">Output: <code data-start=3D"323" dat=
a-end=3D"354">[batch, forecast_hours, H, W]</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"355" data-end=3D"500">
<p data-start=3D"357" data-end=3D"361">Use:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"364" data-end=3D"500">
<li data-start=3D"364" data-end=3D"399">
<p data-start=3D"366" data-end=3D"399">downsampling (strided / pooling),</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"402" data-end=3D"432">
<p data-start=3D"404" data-end=3D"432">upsampling (transpose conv),</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"435" data-end=3D"454">
<p data-start=3D"437" data-end=3D"454">skip connections,</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"457" data-end=3D"500">
<p data-start=3D"459" data-end=3D"500">residual blocks / GroupNorm style la=
yers.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
